  "description": "As a child, CEO Oh Ha-na suffered from severe morbidity after hearing from her first love, Ha Yoon-seong, 'No!' due to clumsy expressions. 10 years have passed without being able to do this or that, and now you hear the news that Yoon-seong will see each other face to face! Will President Oh be able to convey this feverish heart to Ha Yoon-seong, who is reunited again?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%98%A4-%EC%82%AC%EC%9E%A5%EB%8B%98%EC%9D%80-%EC%83%81%EC%82%AC%EB%B3%91/2979), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60177093)",
